<title>SPAIN: Spain's Repsol signs deal with Iraq's SOM.</title>
<headline>Spain's Repsol signs deal with Iraq's SOM.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Repsol has signed a deal with Iraq's State Oil Marketing Organisation (SOMO) to buy 20,000 barrels of crude oil a day for a six month period, a spokeswoman said on Friday.</p>
<p>The deal will run from December 10 until June 7, she added.</p>
<p>The agreement comes under the umbrella of Iraq's &quot;oil for food&quot; deal signed with the United Nations.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
